@startuml
title workflow-job-filter（与 requirements v0.2 对齐）
[*] --> Pending : createTask
Pending --> Running : schedulerDispatch\nsubmitPythonOk
Running --> Succeeded : pythonDone\nfilesRegistered
Running --> Failed : python4xx\nor fatalError
Running --> Failed : timeoutOrRetriesExhausted
Pending --> Failed : validationFailed
@enduml
